  ┌─ NVT PRE-EQUILIBRATION ADVISORY ──────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  Starting NVE from an optimised (0 K) structure without prior NVT     │
  │  equilibration is known to cause:                                      │
  │    • A large initial TE drop (~5–10 kcal/mol) in the first ~20 steps  │
  │    • Actual mean temperature well below the target value               │
  │    • Inflated σ(TE) that cannot be reduced by decreasing dt            │
  │                                                                        │
  │  Recommended workflow (GROMACS Manual 2024 §3.4.2; AMBER 2023 §3.1): │
  │    opt → NVT (≥ 10 ps, Langevin) → NVE (production)                  │
  │                                                                        │
  │  To suppress: set restart=true (assumes prior NVT was completed).     │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘


